bluejetty:00070302:ios.description:
"Learn colors and do coloring!" is one of our best educational games for kids in which your baby playfully learns eleven colors and paints a coloring book.
Why download the game:
1) Your kid learns 11 colors - red, yellow, blue, green, orange, purple (or violet), brown, pink, black, white and gray;
2) Learning colors is available in 20 languages such as English, Spanish, Russian and many others. It’s really cool that your baby can learn names of colors in so many languages!
3) Playing the game your preschooler gets acquainted with many new items and words. So, learning colors broadens your baby’s horizon and enriches his or her vocabulary;
4) 4 enthralling mini games to check and consolidate the received knowledge about colors;
5) Coloring is one the most favorite occupations for young children, so we added 10 fun pictures in the game. These colorings will be interesting for both little boys and girls;
Thank you for choosing our game for your child!
Your opinions are valuable to us, so please do not hesitate to leave reviews on the App Store or send your feedback to our e-mail toplinesolutionsltd@gmail.com

